RI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","review_id":"3Y6pBvIE_UYpMWZ6y0GN5Q","date":"2012-05-03T22:30:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9355220198631287,"text_excerpt":"I really like how you can see them make pralines here. I think that's half the experience as opposed to just buying them in a shop.. THEY'RE FRESH! The ladies are real sweet (for the most part) and you can sample the pralines that are all on the top row. They have a good selection of both white and regular chocolate - it's like chocolate galore, and I felt a little overwhelmed! haha. They also have ice cream and praline gifts for gift giving. 2 pralines cost me $5! A little pricey, but at least I got to try them fresh! FYI - $5 minimum for CC purchases."},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","review_id":"4Zc-1xxzF9sXQ2oAgHHsDg","date":"2014-02-02T08:25:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9345812797546387,"text_excerpt":"Right when you walk into the shop, the smell of sweetness hits you. It smells so good, it's almost overwhelming. I ended up getting a pound of the regular pralines for about 24 bucks to bring home to california. Note, there was like 10-12 pralines in the one pound box. Sweet and sugary. Yum! They even tasted good a week later. They also have other flavored pralines and other goodies to choose from, prepacked as well. Also, you get to watch them make it fresh as you pass by the window."},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","review_id":"nUqBpCnlwHzTlCiI-b6zpg","date":"2017-12-08T16:06:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9330832958221436,"text_excerpt":"11/24/17 Okay, I admit it... I'm a newb at reviewing candy stores. I mean, your typical candy store at the mall, or sometimes on those touristy streets all carry very similar stuff. Buckets of sugary goodness. Tart mouth puckers. Colors galore. Well, at least most in New Orleans ain't really that... Pralines is the big thing here. Different than what I've had in California too, which tend to be like crunchy toffee pieces, or sometimes just the nuts themselves. But I trust these are the correct pralines--I tasted these and they're sorta like semi-hard toffee/caramel encasing fresh nuts, usually not crunchy. And this candy store got tons of pralines and all the other favorites of New Orlean..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","photo_id":"Fp_NlzE-2zkTC6mlvecRiw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Fp_NlzE-2zkTC6mlvecRiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8591898679733276},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","photo_id":"Wtb1XClohXqGoMaaexP0fQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Wtb1XClohXqGoMaaexP0fQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8349839448928833},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","photo_id":"5SicfvmH-J5X18rNv0p_7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5SicfvmH-J5X18rNv0p_7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8270256519317627},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","photo_id":"WA9Axx1RtZH00IUYAriUhA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WA9Axx1RtZH00IUYAriUhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7758845686912537},{"business_id":"x5IHeDKH72KGBpnxfxa8jQ","photo_id":"J4LWcDJhx9G--LFQPAeaUA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/J4LWcDJhx9G--LFQPAeaUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7283962368965149}]},"notebook_case":null}
